      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BAREFOOT GYPSY (3) comes off an average performance last start when seventh at Q Lakeside over 352m behind Boom Two Down (20.55) in a Grade 5. Looks the one to beat on her best form. DIVORCE PAPERS (1) is mixing form and out of the placings last time but was a Mix 5 winner three starts ago and moves to Box 1 this time where she has performed well. Key player on best and worth another try. SHIFTY BREEZE (7) is a capable type and proved too strong last time to win by a nose at Capalaba in a handy 19.99 beating Jet Springer. Form from his last run is proving strong. Makes plenty of appeal on the back of that last-start win. DASHING TURBO (2) generally performs well here at this distance.",
